Upon further thinking, I think this is how to use junta:

- ma junta ti
-le ka ce'u bunda li ci cu junta ti
The property of being 3 in pounds is the weight of this.

i.e, the x1 of junta has to be a property. But it is a very
atypical gismu in any case.

